Modifications (2026-11-10, 5o1):
  - Visual meshes split by solid body into five materials (painted shell, rubber
    pads, stainless linkage, dark internal steel, aluminium wrist disc).
  - Visual meshes re-exported as GLB and OBJ with smoothed vertex normals.
  - PBR material values estimated from photographs of a G20 hand.
  - Robot names changed to g20_pbr_left / g20_pbr_right; mesh paths changed.
  - MuJoCo models generated from the URDFs; URDF mimic joints expressed as
    MuJoCo joint equality constraints; inertia tensors that MuJoCo rejects
    (A + B < C) balanced by MuJoCo's balanceinertia in the MJCF only.
  In the URDFs, joint definitions, inertial properties and collision meshes are
  unchanged.
